This directory carries the compiled Admin SPA (Vite output, web/dist).

- In the production Docker build, the contents of web/dist are copied over
  this directory right before `go build`, and `//go:embed all:dist` packs the
  files into the API binary.
- This .gitkeep is committed so `go build`/`go test` succeed without a Node
  build (empty embedded FS).
- Do not commit real build artifacts here.